<%- include('head') %><link rel="stylesheet" href="/kpi.css?v=1">
<p><a href="/admin/kpi">KPI dashboard</a></p><div class="heading-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEASUREMENT FRAMEWORK</p><h1>Targets & definitions</h1><p>Set agreed targets separately for each reporting cadence. A blank target is unrated. Changes apply to live scorecards; saved snapshots keep their original settings.</p></div></div>
<form method="post" action="/admin/kpi/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<%= version %>"><section class="panel"><h2>Business enquiry filters</h2><p>Select the categories included in the business lead and conversion cohort. Careers, press, copyright and general enquiries are excluded from this business-outcome framework.</p><div class="kpi-checks"><% businessCategories.forEach(key=>{ %><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="categories" value="<%= key %>" <%= config.categories.includes(key)?'checked':'' %>><%= categories[key] %></label><% }) %></div><label>Amber achievement threshold (%)<input type="number" name="amberPercent" min="1" max="99" step="0.1" value="<%= config.amberPercent %>" required></label><p class="form-help">Green meets the target. For higher-is-better measures amber reaches this percentage of target. For lower-is-better measures amber is at most target divided by this fraction; a zero target has no amber band.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Automatic reporting drafts</h2><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="automaticDrafts" <%= config.automaticDrafts?'checked':'' %>>Create scheduled weekly, monthly and quarterly report drafts</label><p>The running Node service checks every 15 minutes and saves the latest completed week, month and quarter once each. This starts with the most recent completed periods; it does not backfill history. Drafts may lack external figures or commentary. Add these in the live period and save a new revision before approval. Nothing is emailed or automatically approved.</p><p class="form-help">This requires an always-running hosting process. Default: off.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Agreed targets</h2><div class="report-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th>Weekly</th><th>Monthly</th><th>Quarterly</th></tr></thead><tbody><% metricDefinitions.forEach(m=>{ %><tr><th scope="row"><%= m.label %><small class="kpi-source"><%= m.unit %> · <%= m.direction==='lower'?'lower':'higher' %> is better</small></th><% ['weekly','monthly','quarterly'].forEach(c=>{ %><td><input aria-label="<%= c+' target for '+m.label %>" name="<%= c+':'+m.key %>" type="number" min="0" <%- m.unit==='percent'?'max="100" step="0.01"':'step="1"' %> value="<%= config.targets[c]?.[m.key]??'' %>"></td><% }) %></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><button>Save reporting settings</button></section></form>
<section class="panel"><h2>Definitions & limits</h2><p>Calendar weeks run Monday–Sunday, months and quarters use UTC boundaries. Business conversion uses enquiry creation cohorts, not website visitors. Historical live figures can change with spam classification and retention; preserve signed-off snapshots.</p><dl><% metricDefinitions.forEach(m=>{ %><dt><strong><%= m.label %></strong> · <%= m.source %></dt><dd><%= m.definition %></dd><% }) %></dl><p>GA4/Search Console require exact-period exports with source references and filters. No automatic connection, paid subscription, campaign execution or email distribution is enabled by these settings.</p></section><%- include('foot') %>
